# Frosty Bliss

A simple ice cream shop landing page built with Vite.

## Run locally

```bash
npm install
npm run dev -- --host 0.0.0.0
```

Then open http://localhost:3000

## Build for production

```bash
npm run build
```

## Preview production build

```bash
npm run preview -- --host 0.0.0.0
```

## Notes

This app is intentionally lightweight and uses only Vite plus plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript so it runs quickly and requires no extra framework setup.


